    "System.Description": "<p>Testing for User Story <a href=\"https://quorumsoftware.visualstudio.com/Quorum/_workitems/edit/1880262\">1880262</a>. </p>\n<h3>Testing scope </h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Verify that an authorized user can open the Report Designer inside Planning Space Web and load a representative existing template. </li>\n<li>Verify workbook layout and supported content, including worksheets, formulas, styles, merged cells, and named ranges. </li>\n<li>Verify authorization failure, tenant isolation, editor-session isolation, and rejection of invalid host messages. </li>\n<li>Verify loading, retry, error, session-expiry, dirty-state, close, and cleanup behavior. </li>\n<li>Verify repeated open/close cycles and two-user or two-tab scenarios. </li>\n<li>Verify the supported browser and viewport matrix and complete regression testing for affected Planning Space Web navigation. </li>\n<li>Record defects and acceptance results against the parent User Story. </li>\n</ol>",
